        "original_id": "55783601-e337-5479-b388-f38c6c910623",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Shayang County, Mengzhou, Hubei Province, Henan Province, Jingmen City, Maliang Town, People's Republic of China\n- Historical entities: Quan, State of Chu\n- People: Wen Ding, Quan Wending\n\nFacts:\n- Quan was founded by Quan Wending, a son of Wen Ding, in the area of modern-day Maliang Town in Shayang County, Jingmen City, Hubei Province.\n- The founding area of Quan was next to the region where the State of Chu later emerged.\n- Shayang is a county in west-central Hubei Province, People's Republic of China.\n- Mengzhou is a county-level city in Henan Province, People's Republic of China.",
